"Contribution" means a modification, improvement, bug fix,
feature, documentation change, or other work intentionally
submitted for inclusion in the Original Project.

"Local Modification" means a modification made for private,
personal, educational, experimental, or development purposes
which is not distributed to third parties.

"Derivative Project" means a project based on or substantially
derived from LumaOS, including a Fork.

"Distribution" means making LumaOS or a Derivative Project
